        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - The short fight is simple, but a rare weekly drop may require many repeats.\n\n1. Set legacy Raid Difficulty to Normal or Heroic and enter Firelands at Mount Hyjal 47.2,78.1. Both difficulties can drop Flametalon; use a high-level character for the legacy damage bonus.\n\n2. Head east through the Molten Fields toward the large Alysrazor arena, around 64.3,38.0 on the Firelands map. Clear the flame-bird trash and the enemies at its approach so the opening scene can run.\n\n3. Let Majordomo's scene finish and Alysrazor enter combat before attacking. Kill her when she is targetable and loot her body. Ranged attacks make it easier to finish her while she moves; you do not need to perform a full aerial-ring phase to earn the mount.\n\n4. Look for Flametalon of Alysrazor in the loot and use it if present. If farming both Firelands mounts, continue through the other bosses to Ragnaros instead of leaving immediately.\n\n5. Leave the instance, switch between Normal and Heroic and repeat on the second difficulty. After those two eligible clears, wait for the weekly reset or change character. Reset All Instances does not restore boss loot on a cleared weekly difficulty.",
