        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Earning a saddle requires sustained wins in qualifying rated PvP, unless you already have one.\n\n1. Check your bags and bank for a Vicious Saddle. If you already have one, skip directly to the vendor. This mount is still obtainable even though its original Cataclysm-era introduction is old.\n\n2. To earn a new saddle, open the PvP pane's Rated section and inspect the seasonal Vicious mount progress bar. Play the rated brackets listed as eligible and reach the rating threshold shown there; qualifying wins, rather than ordinary random battleground wins, advance this reward.\n\n3. Fill the seasonal bar to receive that season's Vicious mount, then continue qualifying rated wins to fill the repeatable saddle bar. Claim a Vicious Saddle when that bar completes. You can stop as soon as you have one for this purchase.\n\n4. An alternative is progress through the Veteran rated-battleground achievements. The first milestone is 75 wins in the traditional rated battleground format; Rated Battleground Blitz does not count for that achievement according to current Retail reports. Check the current reward and your progress before choosing this longer route.\n\n5. Take 1 Vicious Saddle to Necrolord Sipe in Stormwind City at 76.8,65.5. Select Vicious War Steed, complete the exchange and use the mount item. Check the journal for the corresponding faction version before spending another saddle.",
